{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわっかっぷらーめん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっぷらーめん食べたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近身体が炭酸を求めてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにコーラを飲みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱりデカビタが私はだいすきです。\nメロンジュースもだいすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今はマッチを飲んでいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニでよくグラノーラが入っているいちごのチョコレートを買います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに美味しいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リピート買いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リピ買。(。-∀-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹が空いてきた時間だな⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまはサンドウィッチがたべたいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXSGVD2Y03S8CS6DSX6E9F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかエイリアンみたい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白い!(笑)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}